sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant API
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant C as Codex SDK
  participant W as Scoped Workspace
  participant V as Independent Verifier
  participant Store as Evidence Store
  User->>API: submit goal
  API->>O: create durable run
  O->>O: validate DAG and policy
  O->>C: run bounded task
  C->>W: inspect and edit
  C->>Store: stream execution events
  O->>V: verify final state
  V->>W: execute tests independently
  V->>Store: hash test result and state
  Store-->>API: trace, artifacts, metrics
